        <div class="tagline">Core-Network Infrastructure Solution for Next-Gen Inbound Call Isolation</div>
        
        <h3>The Innovation Overview</h3>
        <p>This architecture introduces an inline, carrier-level AI Receptionist protocol utilizing a Back-to-Back User Agent (B2BUA) pattern. The framework intercepts unrecognized inbound calls at the network signaling layer before triggering the subscriber handset, offering high-velocity, low-latency challenge-response isolation.</p>
        
        <h3>Key Architectural Moats</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>The Whisper Line:</strong> Asynchronous RTP media duplication forks incoming speech to the target handset via a zero-latency WebRTC data channel, allowing live subscriber monitoring.</li>
            <li><strong>Mid-Stream Takeover Matrix:</strong> Instantaneous SIP RE-INVITE session bridging lets users hot-swap the media loop and drop into calls seamlessly.</li>
            <li><strong>Universal Delivery:</strong> Zero device-side apps required; fully compatible with legacy and modern telco stacks at the MNO core.</li>
        </ul>

